+# Worker 05 interactive private DEV contract
+
+This is an owner-05 development contract update, not an accepted release or a relabelled Worker 06 process. The user/root task authorizes an interactive loopback preview, fixed synthetic fixture accounts, fresh local state, and independent Worker 58 checks. No production, provider credentials/account grants, security settings, workflows or external corpus writes are authorized.
+
+Inputs: base `908ca373dfc918f2e33fd5e44260879577bed5c5`; 02 `29f73fea7e6a7b8286c1e07ef20787a001e5ef2a` (development pending acceptance), 03 `e1de8e839954905d82f939730ac5ea79412bc805`, 05 `8dc49b2b3683f2532ee4e3581d105c446f6f575e`, 06 `9b31f7d4de21dd30add0c49b038e5ac31413ec5d`. Code is read as exact regular Git blobs into a bounded private overlay; author checkouts are untouched. No Git writing fixtures or source handler/schema/UI overwrites are used. Dependencies and the pinned cached JAR remain references. Existing shipped app static assets are embedded as normal build inputs; no external corpus is acquired or replicated.
+
+`offmenu-owner05-interactive-composition/2` identifies the input manifest and hashes, app artifact/schema hashes, actual owner/session/root, root task grant reference, permitted fixture actions, actual supplied controls and blocked qualifications. Grant evidence is separate from profile controls. Active instructions supply unrestricted filesystem/network and mandatory auto_review; separate AskForApproval value and named profile are unavailable. User configuration and environment profile are recorded separately. A declaration or JSON hash is not a substitute for independent root/grant verification.
+
+`offmenu-owner05-mock-runtime/2` records owner05, source owner06 and immutable06 pin, actual private cwd/run root/command, PID/boot/birth/loopback port, pinned JAR version/SHA512, mapping hash, immutable native custody, live health and actual Identity/reset test receipts. The original06 code is unmodified and its native custody is preserved. This differs intentionally from the old05 contract that required a06-owned root/process. Worker58 must explicitly consume this updated owner/root contract before claiming combined acceptance; no prior schema or stopped receipt is rewritten to pass.
+
+Qualification is valid only while the same birth, source checksums, JAR and health identity remain live. Every forwarded request rechecks custody/health and adapter sources. Unknown requests never fall back to live vendors. Only settings/user, password/refresh token and logout are exposed through the development Identity seam; Google authorize/callback and unsupported profile/signup/recovery flows stay501. Fixed fixture identities/revocation are not Google consent, credential rotation, real-account linking or production role grants.
+
+`dev-server.mjs` retains the prior owner05 birth-verified lifecycle and exclusive fresh state/run directories. A new descriptor is supplied through OFFMENU_DEV_INTERACTIVE plus its exact SHA256; it cannot mix with legacy composition/deny-all descriptors. `current-run.json` exposes source/owner/run/state/birth/port, actual artifact/hash, author pins, composition hash, grant binding and blocked features. Live status retains artifact object/scalar/pins and explicit interactive/pending-acceptance flags. Shared synthetic actors are available for manual feedback; independent tests may revoke a fixture actor until a valid password re-login.
+
+Start the owned launcher with the exact descriptor and unique OFFMENU_DEV_RUN. Stop only through the own terminal `stop` command or the unchanged `dev-stop.mjs` birth/cwd/command guard. The mock's exact pinned runtime module can administer/stop only its own private custody path; no historical or other-owner process is adopted. A ready user-requested preview remains running for feedback until explicitly stopped or its actual owned identity fails. Native-device reachability, extension installation, real providers and source-admission/corpus transport remain separate gates.
+
+Initial private packet: `/home/user/src/offmenu-data/dev-preview-20261014/workers/worker-05/interactive/0b18df2e-282a-42d7-aa3e-187b304b4383/`. Input manifest SHA256 `4eb72d2450c472815d8d96dc5e3f24611c31bd86ee0528358f4d80ff3181452b`; app artifact SHA256 `608a82b8a4010fa1b5781c8966a240b25a2f2bb4e4d1d6ca41d9e708d627e0d2`; input composition SHA256 `73c906be308a2714ae0fc5695b3dfaf4184f70b1c0f5897ce8a992f675a8b243`. Live descriptor `composition-live.json` SHA256 `a0a20164cafc39c75c04a80ec17bcd73d2d3c4a11d67152ba5b74f686ac30567`. Mock qualification `mock-qualified.json` SHA256 `f3017bfd73e0d9626788585409d3ee7be2fc617288dcca7c25a557f0010f8281`: 176 actual Identity assertions plus2 reset assertions passed; owner05 mock PID695978/birth1923192/loopback19075, source06 unmodified. These are real producer facts, not eight-flow or browser acceptance.
+
+Prior dev8dc and Swiss3328 branches, external state/receipts, node_modules reference and primary main/index are preserved. .venv is absent in05; none was created. Review metadata must keep the Swiss/AFCD source ownership distinction honest. Only owned dev integration/receipt/test files are changed here.
